#### When to use variables

- **Product names, version numbers, URLs** — anything that might change
- **Repeated warnings or disclaimers** — legal text, beta notices, support contacts
- **Shared images or diagrams** — screenshots that appear in multiple guides
- **Common tables or lists** — supported browsers, system requirements, feature matrices
- **Any content reused across two or more step files** — if you find yourself copy-pasting, use a variable

